                                "sense_id": "86e5e958-e3b3-3353-9aec-8533a9f1ded6",
                                "text": "But there was a quality in Mary that did not lightly invite to gallantry—a gravity and a balance that, had he looked closely into the matter, might have explained his laches."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a605b498-71c9-3a8a-b305-efdbcf8764b4",
                        "entry_id": "b5693bbd-8861-3140-9b36-f8ae5d43fa13",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unreasonable delay in bringing a claim alleging a wrong, which means the person who waited shall not be permitted to seek an equitable remedy because the delay prejudiced the moving party."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae4cdfd1-8c4e-43da-94c7-151af809e8ab",
                                "sense_id": "a605b498-71c9-3a8a-b305-efdbcf8764b4",
                                "text": "It ill became him to take advantage of such a laches with the eagerness of a shrewd attorney."
                            }
                        ]
